{
  "declaredLength": 2264,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "你也来当卡友。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E5F67655F53536153CB3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当卡友，当卡友！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F53536153CBFF0C5F53536153CBFF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不识趣的冒牌货。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8BC68DA376845192724C8D27300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉才不会说这种话。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C8389624D4E0D4F1A8BF48FD979CD8BDD300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然骗不了你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C71369A974E0D4E864F60300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过要让更多人领略卡娜莉的魅力，\n刚才这招也算是个法子吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC789818BA966F4591A4EBA9886756553615A1C838976849B45529BFF0C000A521A624D8FD962DB4E5F7B97662F4E2A6CD55B505427FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不需要跟风卡友。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D970089818DDF98CE536153CB300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只有从心底喜爱卡娜莉的人，\n才有资格成为卡友。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA67094ECE5FC35E95559C723153615A1C838976844EBAFF0C000A624D67098D44683C62104E3A536153CB300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那可不成！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A353EF4E0D6210FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是只有花钱花时间的才叫粉丝，\n隐约觉得喜欢的也是正儿八经的粉丝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F53EA670982B194B182B165F695F47684624D53EB7C894E1DFF0C000A96907EA689C95F97559C6B2276844E5F662F6B63513F516B7ECF76847C894E1D300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃……\n要我容忍跟风卡友？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "544320262026000A898162115BB95FCD8DDF98CE536153CBFF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爷爷！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72377237FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我也理解沐净的心情，\n但我不希望你们发生争执～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662114E5F740689E36C9051C076845FC360C5FF0C000A4F4662114E0D5E0C671B4F604EEC53D1751F4E896267FF5E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也是！训练家之间发生争执的话，\n就用宝可梦对战来一决胜负吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F662FFF018BAD7EC35BB64E4B95F453D1751F4E89626776848BDDFF0C000A5C3175285B9D53EF68A65BF9621867654E0051B380DC8D1F5427FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下次再说",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6B21518D8BF40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我打一场吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA9621162534E00573A5427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作为一名卡友，\n我要证明自己是真爱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C4E3A4E00540D536153CBFF0C000A621189818BC1660E81EA5DF1662F771F7231300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然不想让爷爷为所欲为，\n但我是想和沐净对战的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71364E0D60F38BA9723772374E3A62406B324E3AFF0C000A4F466211662F60F3548C6C9051C05BF9621876843002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我实质上也算是个卡娜莉。\n能和两个卡娜莉对战，棒极了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115B9E8D284E0A4E5F7B97662F4E2A53615A1C83893002000A80FD548C4E244E2A53615A1C83895BF96218FF0C68D267814E865427FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战嘛！\n机会难得啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF96218561BFF01000A673A4F1A96BE5F97554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和你们交手倒是可以，\n但胜利是属于我的哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C4F604EEC4EA4624B5012662F53EF4EE5FF0C000A4F4680DC5229662F5C5E4E8E6211768454E6FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你想做什么呀？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6060F3505A4EC04E485440FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是我们赢了，\n你们的伙伴也都要成为卡友！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F62114EEC8D624E86FF0C000A4F604EEC76844F194F344E5F90FD898162104E3A536153CBFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身为卡友，\n我要展现自己的真爱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB4E3A536153CBFF0C000A621189815C5573B081EA5DF17684771F7231300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次我会秀出真正的实力！\n麻麻鳗鱼王，用超级进化一飞冲天吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B2162114F1A79C051FA771F6B6376845B9E529BFF01000A9EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738BFF0C75288D857EA78FDB53164E0098DE51B259295427FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了实现我的策略，\n超级进化吧，龙头地鼠！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E865B9E73B0621176847B567565FF0C000A8D857EA78FDB53165427FF0C9F99593457309F20FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶灯火灵……\n通过超级进化来展示真爱吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C346676706F706B707520262026000A901A8FC78D857EA78FDB531667655C55793A771F72315427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可是个认真的卡友……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF662F4E2A8BA4771F7684536153CB20262026FF0100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沐净……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9051C020262026001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，卡娜莉的魅力\n确实应该让更多人领略。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C53615A1C838976849B45529B000A786E5B9E5E948BE58BA966F4591A4EBA98867565300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉丝的确很重要，\n但更重要的，还是沐净你啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C894E1D7684786E5F8891CD8981FF0C000A4F4666F491CD89817684FF0C8FD8662F6C9051C04F60554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……♡<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF20262026266100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，用全息卡娜莉来骗人\n这一点可不好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C75285168606F53615A1C838967659A974EBA000A8FD94E0070B953EF4E0D597D300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说你呢！\n爷爷！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF44F605462FF01000A72377237FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，\n你们两个收下这个。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C000A4F604EEC4E244E2A65364E0B8FD94E2A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n另一种颜色的卡娜莉装扮套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A53E64E0079CD989C8272768453615A1C838988C5626E595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说在美发沙龙\n还有人模仿我的发型呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF457287F8E53D16C999F99000A8FD867094EBA6A214EFF6211768453D1578B54623002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那还真是\n让人头疼……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A38FD8771F662F000A8BA94EBA593475BC2026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沐净就不用说了，\n顺便也请你今后多多指教啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9051C05C314E0D75288BF44E86FF0C000A987A4FBF4E5F8BF74F604ECA540E591A591A630765595566FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来，还是赢不了你啊。\n麻麻鳗鱼王它们明明都努力锻炼过的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C8FD8662F8D624E0D4E864F60554A3002000A9EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738B5B834EEC660E660E90FD52AA529B953B70BC8FC776843002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了吸引更多人加入粉丝团，\n接下来该制作什么样的粉丝周边呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8654385F1566F4591A4EBA52A051657C894E1D56E2FF0C000A63A54E0B67658BE552364F5C4EC04E48683776847C894E1D54688FB95462FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C8389300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    }
